    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期和大家分享在生活中，我们遇到的那些下头、敏感时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>成年人的边界感和分寸感是一种点到为止的默契，懂得回避、进退得宜、适可而止...</span></p><span></span><p><span>有点敏感也没关系，没有人是一座孤岛，每个人对舒适有自己的见解和标准，所以树立自己的边界感，做自己就很好</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 下头时刻常有，猛猛戳雷点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 我说你们爱开黄腔的男的别太离谱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> 身边那些让人无奈且爱杠的网络爹妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 当场回怼vs大生闷气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a>边界感，成年人之间该有的默契</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3452">57:32</a>学会断舍离，停止友情内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4451">74:11</a>不是，哥们你的眼力见呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎶</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP- 爱在西元前 &nbsp;By周杰伦</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED- 不亏不欠 &nbsp;By袁娅维</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤</span></p><span></span><p><span>固定主播：Vicky 、Eva</span></p>]]></description>
